gifcap includes FFmpeg.

FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) is linked statically as libavcodec, libavformat, libavutil, and libswscale. This build does not enable GPL-only FFmpeg components, so those libraries are used under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later. The text is in COPYING. The license page is https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html.

The FFmpeg version built into a given executable is listed in THIRD-PARTY.txt next to that executable. Source for this FFmpeg port is the tag named in that file.

The executable also contains Rust crates. Their names, versions, authors, and license texts are in THIRD-PARTY.txt.

Source code for gifcap: https://github.com/machine202502/gifcap
